{"id":"A1-L053","title":"Subject + verb + complement: form","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U04","focus":"Subject + verb + complement — forma","targets":{"grammar":"Subject + verb + complement — forma","pron":"do you (fala rápida)","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":["That’s nice!"],"words":["plant","moon","wind","snow","storm","fog","soon","weather"],"field":"Moradia","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Fala","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 53 · Subject + verb + complement: form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Subject + verb + complement — forma.","**Expressões:** That’s nice!.","**Pronúncia:** do you (fala rápida).","**8 palavras novas** (moradia).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo montar frases com complemento (lugar, tempo, modo) e usar That’s nice!"},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["plant","planta"],["moon","lua"],["wind","vento"],["snow","neve"],["storm","tempestade"],["fog","neblina"],["soon","em breve"],["weather","tempo (clima)"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"eva@mail.com","to":"tom@mail.com","subject":"My new flat","paras":["Hi Tom!","I live **in a new flat**. It is **bright** and **clean**. I study **at the table** every night. I work **from home** on Friday.","My neighbor is **very kind**. He often says, “**That’s nice!**” when I show him my plants.","Visit me soon! Eva"],"gloss":[["bright","claro"],["plant","planta"],["neighbor","vizinho"],["often","frequentemente"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Eva lives in a new flat.","ans":"T","why":"“in a new flat.”"},{"q":"The flat is dark.","ans":"F","why":"“bright and clean.”"},{"q":"Eva works from home on Friday.","ans":"T","why":"“from home on Friday.”"},{"q":"Eva has a cat.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“plant” means…","opts":["planta","prato","vaso"],"ans":0,"why":"plant = planta."},{"q":"“often” means…","opts":["frequentemente","nunca","raramente"],"ans":0,"why":"often = frequentemente."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Subject + verb + complement","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["S","V","Complemento"],"rows":[["I","**live**","**in a flat**"],["I","**study**","**at the table**"],["She","**works**","**from home on Friday**"]],"cap":"Complementos"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Ordem do complemento","body":"**Lugar → Tempo**: *I study **at home** **every night**.* (lugar antes do tempo)"},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Não coloque o complemento antes do verbo: *I at home study.* ✗"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I live ___ a flat. (in)","a":"in","why":"in + lugar."},{"s":"She works ___ home. (from)","a":"from","why":"from home."},{"s":"I study ___ the table. (at)","a":"at","why":"at the table."},{"s":"___ nice! (That’s)","a":"That’s","why":"That’s nice!","say":"That’s nice"}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["plant","planta"],["moon","lua"],["wind","vento"],["snow","neve"],["storm","tempestade"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["the","table","At"],"ans":"At the table","pt":"Na mesa."},{"words":["flat","In","a","new"],"ans":"In a new flat","pt":"Num apartamento novo."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"